          "fill": "$gray-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Evergreen.ai is a service offered by Evergreen Wealth Advisors, an SEC-registered investment adviser. It provides financial advice based on information you provide and accounts you choose to link, and is self-service: you ask questions, and the platform responds based on the information available at that time. It does not monitor your accounts between sessions, and use of Evergreen.ai does not by itself create an investment advisory relationship with Evergreen Wealth Advisors.",
          "lineHeight": 1.43,
          "fontFamily": "Heebo",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "300"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "a30gbx",
          "name": "Paragraph 2",
          "fill": "$gray-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Use of Evergreen.ai is not a substitute for advice from a licensed financial professional, attorney, or CPA. Consult a qualified professional before making significant financial decisions.Nothing herein should be construed as an offer, recommendation, or solicitation to buy or sell any security. All investing involves risk, including the possible loss of principal, and past performance does not guarantee future results.",
          "lineHeight": 1.43,
          "fontFamily": "Heebo",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "300"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "uR1Ks",
          "name": "Paragraph 4",
          "fill": "$gray-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "By using this website and Evergreen.ai you understand the information being presented is provided for informational purposes only and agree to our Terms of Use and Privacy Policy.",
